          "excerpt": "He called it a “typical exercise in unilateralism and protectionism” intended to “suppress and block Chinese products”, and accused Washington of “blaming external factors for its own economic problems”.",
          "sentence_hash": "3e53b3013e5e04fa88272c9f7e35c37ffd207f9f5ff2e1ea4e844026ba8d0ad7",
          "anchors": [
            "its",
            "us"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "“The high differentiated tariffs imposed by the United States are the real cause threatening the security of global supply chains,” He said.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-21T08:06:58.916321+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "114dab8325caffd2c6f95059db7fb46441d0d890bf4018538b869dfbde5c75ee",
          "excerpt": "“The high differentiated tariffs imposed by the United States are the real cause threatening the security of global supply chains,” He said.",
