          "anchors": [
            "us"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "Its estimates of 450,000 American jobs and up to US$150 billion in lost output are presented as model-based illustrations, although the text concedes that the shift in US import sourcing after 2018 does not prove all displaced Chinese trade was illegally diverted.",
